    "subtopic": "Trigonometric Equations and General Solutions",
    "difficulty": "MODERATE",
    "stem": "If \\(\\sqrt{3}\\cos x - \\sin x = 1\\), then the general value of \\(x\\) is ______.",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "\\(2n\\pi \\pm \\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\)"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "\\(2n\\pi \\pm \\dfrac{\\pi}{6}\\)"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "\\(2n\\pi \\pm \\dfrac{\\pi}{3} - \\dfrac{\\pi}{6}\\)"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "\\(n\\pi + (-1)^{n}\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\)"}
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "solution": "Divide by \\(2\\): \\(\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cos x-\\tfrac12\\sin x=\\tfrac12\\Rightarrow\\cos\\!\\left(x+\\tfrac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=\\tfrac12=\\cos\\tfrac{\\pi}{3}\\Rightarrow x+\\tfrac{\\pi}{6}=2n\\pi\\pm\\tfrac{\\pi}{3}\\Rightarrow x=2n\\pi\\pm\\tfrac{\\pi}{3}-\\tfrac{\\pi}{6}\\)."
  },
  {
    "ref": "Misc I Q.7",
    "bucket": "exercise-mcq",
    "format": "mcq",
    "subtopic": "Solution of Triangle — Sine, Cosine and Projection Rules",
    "difficulty": "MODERATE",
    "stem": "In \\(\\triangle ABC\\), if \\(\\angle A = 45^{\\circ},\\ \\angle B = 30^{\\circ}\\), then the ratio \\(a : b : c = \\) ______.",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "\\(2 : \\sqrt{2} : \\sqrt{3}+1\\)"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "\\(\\sqrt{2} : 2 : \\sqrt{3}+1\\)"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "\\(2\\sqrt{2} : \\sqrt{2} : \\sqrt{3}\\)"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "\\(2 : 2\\sqrt{2} : \\sqrt{3}+1\\)"}
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "solution": "\\(C=105^{\\circ}\\). By sine rule \\(a:b:c=\\sin45^{\\circ}:\\sin30^{\\circ}:\\sin105^{\\circ}=\\tfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}:\\tfrac12:\\tfrac{\\sqrt6+\\sqrt2}{4}\\). Multiply by \\(4\\): \\(2\\sqrt2:2:\\sqrt2(\\sqrt3+1)\\); divide by \\(\\sqrt2\\): \\(2:\\sqrt2:\\sqrt3+1\\)."
  },
  {
    "ref": "Misc I Q.8",
    "bucket": "exercise-mcq",
    "format": "mcq",
    "subtopic": "Solution of Triangle — Sine, Cosine and Projection Rules",
    "difficulty": "MODERATE",
    "stem": "In \\(\\triangle ABC\\), if \\(c^{2} + a^{2} - b^{2} = ac\\), then \\(\\angle B = \\) ______.",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\)"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}\\)"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\)"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "\\(\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}\\)"}
    ],
