    "solution": "\\(ac\\cos B=\\tfrac12(a^{2}+c^{2}-b^{2})\\) and \\(bc\\cos A=\\tfrac12(b^{2}+c^{2}-a^{2})\\); subtracting gives \\(\\tfrac12(2a^{2}-2b^{2})=a^{2}-b^{2}\\)."
