    "solution": "Angles in A.P. \\(\\Rightarrow B=60^{\\circ}\\). By sine rule \\(\\sin B:\\sin C=\\sqrt3:\\sqrt2\\Rightarrow\\sin C=\\tfrac{\\sqrt3/2\\cdot\\sqrt2}{\\sqrt3}=\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\Rightarrow C=45^{\\circ}\\); so \\(A=180^{\\circ}-60^{\\circ}-45^{\\circ}=75^{\\circ}\\)."
  },
  {
